<ol class="method">
  <li><h3>Discover</h3><p>Read everything: accounts, minutes, contracts, bids, the risk register.</p></li>
  <li><h3>Listen</h3><p>Trustees, staff, funders, partners and the people you serve, in their own words.</p></li>
  <li><h3>Interpret</h3><p>Test what people say against what the documents show.</p></li>
  <li><h3>Challenge</h3><p>Ask the hard why. Aim the challenge at systems, not people.</p></li>
  <li><h3>Prioritise</h3><p>What to invest in first, what to stop, and what to defer.</p></li>
  <li><h3>Align</h3><p>A decision sheet, a 90-day plan and a minute block, so the work gets used.</p></li>
</ol>
